-8d86-1817e5401942' class='top-nav-item'><a href='https://aksaray.diyanet.gov.tr/Sayfalar/SiteMap.aspx'>Site Haritası</a></li><li id='edad26ab-b82c-467c-8524-0f47ae509ff0' class='top-nav-item'><a href='https://aksaray.diyanet.gov.tr/Sayfalar/contentdetail.aspx?ContentId=iletisim&MenuCategory=Kurumsal2'>İletişim</a></li></ul>
